<body>
<header class="hero">
<div class="kicker">✦ THE TRAVEL SCRAPBOOK ✦</div>
<h1>Souvenir Hunt!</h1>
<p>You are exploring a new city. Visit the souvenir shops, learn the words, listen to a real-life shopping conversation and complete your own shopping challenge.</p>
<div class="meta"><span class="pill">A0–A1 · Beginner</span><span class="pill">60-minute lesson</span><span class="pill">Vocabulary · Listening · Grammar · Speaking</span></div>
<div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress" id="progress"></div></div>
</header>
<div class="layout">
<nav><strong>✦ Your travel map</strong>
<a href="#m1">1. Souvenir shop</a><a href="#m2">2. Memory challenge</a><a href="#m3">3. Travel talk</a><a href="#m4">4. Listening</a><a href="#m5">5. Souvenir gallery</a><a href="#m6">6. Grammar workshop</a><a href="#final">7. Shopping challenge</a><a href="#homework">Home task</a>
</nav>
<main>
<section class="sheet" id="m1">
<div class="section-top"><span class="badge">MISSION 1 · 8 MIN</span><div><h2>Welcome to the souvenir shop!</h2><p class="lead">Look, listen and learn. Click each card to hear the word.</p></div></div>
<img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A London souvenir shop with souvenirs in the window">
<div class="vocab-grid" id="coreVocab">
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a cap')"><span class="emoji">🧢</span><b>a cap</b><small>/kæp/ · click to listen</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a football scarf')"><span class="emoji">🧣</span><b>a football scarf</b><small>/ˈfʊtbɔːl skɑːf/</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a football shirt')"><span class="emoji">👕</span><b>a football shirt</b><small>/ˈfʊtbɔːl ʃɜːt/</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a key ring')"><span class="emoji">🔑</span><b>a key ring</b><small>/ˈkiː rɪŋ/</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a mug')"><span class="emoji">☕</span><b>a mug</b><small>/mʌɡ/</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a plate')"><span class="emoji">🍽️</span><b>a plate</b><small>/pleɪt/</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a teddy')"><span class="emoji">🧸</span><b>a teddy</b><small>/ˈtedi/</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a T-shirt')"><span class="emoji">👚</span><b>a T-shirt</b><small>/ˈtiː ʃɜːt/</small></div>
</div>
<div class="hint"><b>Remember:</b> A souvenir is something you buy and keep to remember a place or a trip.</div>
<div class="actions"><button onclick="say('A cap. A football scarf. A football shirt. A key ring. A mug. A plate. A teddy. A T-shirt.')">🔊 Listen to all 8 words</button><button class="soft" onclick="say('souvenir')">🔊 Souvenir</button></div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" id="m2">
<div class="section-top"><span class="badge">MISSION 2 · 6 MIN</span><div><h2>Memory challenge</h2><p class="lead">Look at the picture. Can you remember all eight objects without looking at the vocabulary?</p></div></div>
<div class="scene"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Eight London-themed souvenir objects arranged on a light background"></div>
<p><b>Write the words.</b> Use one word or phrase for each picture.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="q">1. <input id="m2a" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">2. <input id="m2b" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">3. <input id="m2c" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">4. <input id="m2d" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">5. <input id="m2e" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">6. <input id="m2f" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">7. <input id="m2g" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
<div class="q">8. <input id="m2h" type="text" placeholder="What is it?"></div>
</div>
<div class="actions"><button class="primary" onclick="checkMemory()">Check my memory</button><button onclick="clearInputs(['m2a','m2b','m2c','m2d','m2e','m2f','m2g','m2h'])">Try again</button></div><div class="feedback" id="m2fb"></div>
<div class="hint">Speaking: Which souvenir do you like? Which souvenir don't you like? Tell your teacher.</div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" id="m3">
<div class="section-top"><span class="badge">MISSION 3 · 5 MIN</span><div><h2>Souvenirs around the world</h2><p class="lead">Every city has special things to remember it by.</p></div></div>
<img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A colourful Mediterranean souvenir market">
<div class="grid">
<div class="panel"><h3>Look and think</h3><p>What can you see?</p><p class="tiny">Look carefully and describe the souvenirs you notice. Try to remember the words from Mission 1 and use any new words you know.</p></div>
<div class="panel"><h3>Talk about you</h3><p>Use these easy sentence starters:</p><ul><li>I like ...</li><li>I buy ...</li><li>My favourite souvenir is ...</li><li>I don't collect ...</li></ul></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><b>1.</b> Do you buy souvenirs when you visit a new city?<div class="options"><button onclick="say('Yes, I do.')">Yes, I do.</button><button onclick="say('No, I do not.')">No, I don't.</button><button onclick="say('Sometimes.')">Sometimes.</button></div></div>
<div class="q"><b>2.</b> What is a typical souvenir from your city? <input type="text" placeholder="In my city, people buy..."></div>
<div class="q"><b>3.</b> Do you collect anything? What would you like to collect? <input type="text" placeholder="I collect... / I would like to collect..."></div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" id="m4">
<div class="section-top"><span class="badge">MISSION 4 · 12 MIN</span><div><h2>Listening: At the souvenir shop</h2><p class="lead">Listen to a short conversation. Two different characters speak. First, listen without reading.</p></div></div>
<img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A customer talking to a souvenir shop assistant">
<div class="actions"><button class="primary" onclick="playShopDialogue()">▶ Play the dialogue</button><button onclick="playShopDialogue(true)">🐢 Slow listening</button><button onclick="stopSpeech()">■ Stop</button></div>
<div class="hint"><b>Listening tip:</b> Listen for the object words and the prices. You do not need to understand every word.</div>
<h3>Task A · Listen and complete the prices</h3>
<p class="tiny">Type the numbers you hear.</p>
<div class="answer-row"><span>1. The T-shirt costs £ ...</span><input id="price1" type="number" min="0" placeholder="Price"></div>
<div class="answer-row"><span>2. The key ring costs £ ...</span><input id="price2" type="number" min="0" placeholder="Price"></div>
<div class="answer-row"><span>3. The mug costs £ ...</span><input id="price3" type="number" min="0" placeholder="Price"></div>
<div class="actions"><button class="primary" onclick="checkPrices()">Check prices</button></div><div class="feedback" id="pricefb"></div>
<h3>Task B · What does the woman buy?</h3>
<div class="options" id="buyChoices"><button onclick="chooseBuy(this,'mug')">A mug</button><button onclick="chooseBuy(this,'key ring')">A key ring</button><button onclick="chooseBuy(this,'T-shirt')">A T-shirt</button><button onclick="chooseBuy(this,'nothing')">Nothing</button></div><div class="feedback" id="buyfb"></div>
<h3>Task C · Read the dialogue</h3>
<div class="dialogue">
<div class="line" onclick="say('Hello. Can I help you?')"><span class="speaker">Shop assistant:</span>Hello. Can I help you?</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('Yes, please. How much is that T-shirt?')"><span class="speaker">Customer:</span>Yes, please. How much is that T-shirt?</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('It is twelve pounds.')"><span class="speaker">Shop assistant:</span>It's twelve pounds.</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('Oh, that is a little expensive. How much is this key ring?')"><span class="speaker">Customer:</span>Oh, that's a little expensive. How much is this key ring?</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('It is four pounds.')"><span class="speaker">Shop assistant:</span>It's four pounds.</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('Great. And how much is that mug?')"><span class="speaker">Customer:</span>Great. And how much is that mug?</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('It is six pounds.')"><span class="speaker">Shop assistant:</span>It's six pounds.</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('I will take the key ring, please.')"><span class="speaker">Customer:</span>I'll take the key ring, please.</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('Of course. Here you are.')"><span class="speaker">Shop assistant:</span>Of course. Here you are.</div>
<div class="line" onclick="say('Thank you. Goodbye!')"><span class="speaker">Customer:</span>Thank you. Goodbye!</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" id="m5">
<div class="section-top"><span class="badge">MISSION 5 · 7 MIN</span><div><h2>The souvenir gallery</h2><p class="lead">Explore more things you can find in a souvenir shop. Click a card to hear the word.</p></div></div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a magnet')"><span class="emoji">🧲</span><b>a magnet</b><small>click to listen</small></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a postcard')"><span class="emoji">💌</span><b>a postcard</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a keychain')"><span class="emoji">🔑</span><b>a keychain</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a miniature')"><span class="emoji">🏠</span><b>a miniature</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a bracelet')"><span class="emoji">📿</span><b>a bracelet</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a shell')"><span class="emoji">🐚</span><b>a shell</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a bag')"><span class="emoji">👜</span><b>a bag</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a snow globe')"><span class="emoji">❄️</span><b>a snow globe</b></div>
<div class="vocab" onclick="say('a fridge magnet')"><span class="emoji">🗺️</span><b>a fridge magnet</b></div>
</div>
<h3>Quick check · Choose the correct word</h3>
<div class="q"><b>1.</b> You put it on the fridge. <select id="g5a"><option value="">Choose...</option><option>magnet</option><option>shell</option><option>bag</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>2.</b> You send it to a friend. <select id="g5b"><option value="">Choose...</option><option>bracelet</option><option>postcard</option><option>mug</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>3.</b> You wear it on your wrist. <select id="g5c"><option value="">Choose...</option><option>miniature</option><option>bracelet</option><option>plate</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>4.</b> It is a small model of a building. <select id="g5d"><option value="">Choose...</option><option>miniature</option><option>key ring</option><option>teddy</option></select></div>
<div class="actions"><button class="primary" onclick="checkGallery()">Check answers</button></div><div class="feedback" id="g5fb"></div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" id="m6">
<div class="section-top"><span class="badge">MISSION 6 · 10 MIN</span><div><h2>Grammar workshop: this, that, these, those</h2><p class="lead">We use these words to show if something is near or far.</p></div></div>
<div class="grammar-cards">
<div class="grammar-card"><strong>THIS</strong><b>one · near</b><p>This mug</p><small>☕ in my hand</small></div>
<div class="grammar-card"><strong>THAT</strong><b>one · far</b><p>That shop</p><small>🏬 over there</small></div>
<div class="grammar-card"><strong>THESE</strong><b>many · near</b><p>These keys</p><small>🔑 in my hand</small></div>
<div class="grammar-card"><strong>THOSE</strong><b>many · far</b><p>Those T-shirts</p><small>👕 over there</small></div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>Easy rule:</b> THIS = one + near · THAT = one + far · THESE = many + near · THOSE = many + far.</div>
<h3>Look at the souvenir shop</h3>
<div class="grid">
<div class="panel"><b>HERE</b><p>Near me.</p><p><i>This mug is here.</i></p></div>
<div class="panel"><b>THERE</b><p>Not here; at another place.</p><p><i>The shop is there.</i></p></div>
<div class="panel"><b>OVER THERE</b><p>Far away; I point to it.</p><p><i>Those caps are over there.</i></p></div>
<div class="panel"><b>Listen and repeat</b><p>Here · there · over there</p><button onclick="say('Here. There. Over there.')">🔊 Listen</button></div>
</div>
<h3>Task A · Choose the correct word</h3>
<div class="q"><b>1.</b> (one, near) ___ is a lovely mug. <div class="options"><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q1','This')">This</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q1','Those')">Those</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q1','That')">That</button></div><span class="tiny" id="q1"></span></div>
<div class="q"><b>2.</b> (many, far) ___ T-shirts are expensive. <div class="options"><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q2','Those')">Those</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q2','These')">These</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q2','This')">This</button></div><span class="tiny" id="q2"></span></div>
<div class="q"><b>3.</b> (many, near) ___ key rings are nice. <div class="options"><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q3','These')">These</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q3','That')">That</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q3','Those')">Those</button></div><span class="tiny" id="q3"></span></div>
<div class="q"><b>4.</b> (one, far) ___ teddy is cute. <div class="options"><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q4','That')">That</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q4','These')">These</button><button class="choice" onclick="markChoice(this,'q4','This')">This</button></div><span class="tiny" id="q4"></span></div>
<h3>Task B · Complete the mini-dialogue</h3>
<div class="dialogue">
<p>Customer: Excuse me. How much is <select id="b1"><option value="">...</option><option>this</option><option>those</option></select> mug here?</p>
<p>Assistant: It's £6.</p>
<p>Customer: And how much are <select id="b2"><option value="">...</option><option>these</option><option>that</option></select> key rings?</p>
<p>Assistant: They're £4.</p>
<p>Customer: And what are <select id="b3"><option value="">...</option><option>those</option><option>this</option></select> over there?</p>
<p>Assistant: They're little London buses.</p>
</div>
<div class="actions"><button class="primary" onclick="checkGrammar()">Check grammar</button></div><div class="feedback" id="grammarfb"></div>
</section>

<section class="sheet" id="final">
